</div></div></div><div class="site-inner"><div class="content-sidebar-wrap"><main class="content" id="genesis-content"><div class="breadcrumb"> <span class="breadcrumb-link-wrap"><a class="breadcrumb-link" href="https://busytoddler.com/"><span class="breadcrumb-link-text-wrap">Busy Toddler</span></a><meta ></span> » <span class="breadcrumb-link-wrap"><a class="breadcrumb-link" href="https://busytoddler.com/category/playing-preschool-by-busy-toddler/"><span class="breadcrumb-link-text-wrap">Playing Preschool</span></a><meta ></span> » Playing Preschool Book List Year 1</div><article class="post-52929 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-playing-preschool-by-busy-toddler entry" aria-label="Playing Preschool Book List Year 1"><header class="entry-header"><h1 class="entry-title">Playing Preschool Book List Year 1</h1>
<p class="entry-meta"><a href="https://busytoddler.com/about" class="author-link"><img src="https://busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/susie-headshop-new1.png"  height="50" width="50" style="width:50px;height:50px"  class="avatar" /></a> <span class="entry-author">Author: <a href="https://busytoddler.com/about/" class="entry-author-link" rel="author"><span class="entry-author-name">Susie</span></a></span>    <time class="entry-time">Published: 04/22/2020</time>    <time class="entry-modified-time">Updated: 08/20/2021</time><br /><br /><br /></p></header><div class="entry-content"><div style='display:none;' class='shareaholic-canvas' data-app='share_buttons' data-title='Playing Preschool Book List Year 1' data-link='https://busytoddler.com/playing-preschool-book-list-year-1/' data-app-id-name='post_above_content'></div>
<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph">Thank you so much for your purchase of Playing Preschool Year 1. I am delighted to have you here and can&#8217;t wait to for the upcoming year of learning to unfold for your family.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-blue-color has-text-color">A Reminder About Books</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">While the books in Playing Preschool have been carefully selected and vetted for developmental appropriateness and adherence to the unit&#8217;s theme, <strong>they are suggestions only.</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Only a few times in Playing Preschool does an activity align exactly with a book. The vast majority of book titles can be exchanged for any book that aligns with the topic. For example, any children&#8217;s book on apples can be used. I have merely offered a few recommendations.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-parafont has-blue-color has-text-color">Thoughts on Collecting Books</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Do not feel any pressure to buy every book used in the program. Check out books from the library, look online, borrow from neighbors, ask friends on Facebook &#8211; see what your community has to offer.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">After finishing a unit, if a book became a treasured favorite, that&#8217;s a better reason to buy a book now that the relationship with the text has been established.</p>



<div style="padding-left:2%;padding-right:2%;padding-bottom:0.5%;padding-top:2%;margin-top:1%;margin-bottom:1%" class="wp-block-genesis-blocks-gb-container is-style-blueaborder is-style-redborder gb-block-container"><div class="gb-container-inside"><div class="gb-container-image-wrap"><img decoding="async" class="gb-container-image has-background-dim-10 has-background-dim" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" data-lazy-src="https://playingpreschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/PP-Pattern.png"/><noscript><img decoding="async" class="gb-container-image has-background-dim-10 has-background-dim" src="https://playingpreschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/PP-Pattern.png" alt=""/></noscript></div><div class="gb-container-content" style="max-width:837px">
